WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Review the original PDF, then open Rearrange content.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Choose the source page and select the content to move.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Choose the destination page, position the selection and Apply move.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Move the next section into the space on the destination page.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Repeat for the remaining content, then Apply and close.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
In Arrange, exclude the page that is now empty.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Export and save the rearranged PDF.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.630
Open the saved PDF and check both pages.
